msgid ""
"Package not available in the enabled repositories. It may come from the AUR, "
"belong to a disabled repository (such as multilib), or the package database "
"may be outdated.\n"
"Suggestion: Update the whole system with 'sudo pacman -Syu' and try again."
msgstr ""
"Paket nije dostupan u omogućеним repozitorijima. Možda dolazi iz AUR-a, "
"pripada onemogućenoj repozitoriju (kao što je multilib) ili je baza podataka "
"paketa zastarjela.  \n"
"Preporuka: Ažurirajte cijeli sustav s 'sudo pacman -Syu' i pokušajte ponovo."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 319
msgid ""
"A conflict prevented the operation from completing.\n"
"Suggestion: Clean the cache and update with 'sudo pacman -Scc' followed by "
"'sudo pacman -Syyu'."
msgstr ""
"Sukob je spriječio dovršetak operacije.\n"
"Preporuka: Očistite predmemoriju i ažurirajte s 'sudo pacman -Scc' zatim "
"'sudo pacman -Syyu'."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 327
msgid ""
"Some files from this package already exist on the system.\n"
"Suggestion: Check which package owns the file with 'pacman -Qo <file_path>' "
"and resolve the conflict."
msgstr ""
"Neki su datoteke iz ovog paketa već prisutne na sustavu.\n"
"Preporuka: Provjerite kojem paketu pripada datoteka s 'pacman -Qo "
"<file_path>' i riješite sukob."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 335
msgid ""
"Required dependencies could not be resolved.\n"
"Suggestion: Update the full system first with 'sudo pacman -Syu'."
msgstr ""
"Nije bilo moguće riješiti potrebne ovisnosti.\n"
"Preporuka: Prvo ažurirajte cijeli sustav s 'sudo pacman -Syu'."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 342
msgid ""
"Package signature could not be verified.\n"
"Suggestion: Update your keyrings with 'sudo pacman -S archlinux-keyring "
"manjaro-keyring'."
msgstr ""
"Potpis paketa nije mogao biti verificiran.\n"
"Preporuka: Ažurirajte svoje ključne prstenove s 'sudo pacman -S archlinux-"
"keyring manjaro-keyring'."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 350
msgid ""
"The package database is locked by another process.\n"
"If no other package manager is running, remove the lock with 'sudo rm /var/"
"lib/pacman/db.lck'."
msgstr ""
"Baza podataka paketa je zaključana od strane drugog procesa.\n"
"Ako nijedan drugi upravitelj paketa ne radi, uklonite zaključavanje naredbom "
"'sudo rm /var/lib/pacman/db.lck'."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 358
msgid ""
"Not enough disk space to complete the operation.\n"
"Suggestion: Free space by clearing the package cache with 'sudo pacman -Scc'."
msgstr ""
"Nema dovoljno slobodnog prostora na disku za dovršetak operacije.\n"
"Prijedlog: Oslobodite prostor čišćenjem predmemorije paketa naredbom 'sudo "
"pacman -Scc'."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 366
msgid ""
"Could not download required files.\n"
"Suggestion: Check your internet connection. If the problem persists, try "
"updating your mirror list."
msgstr ""
"Nije moguće preuzeti potrebne datoteke.\n"
"Prijedlog: Provjerite svoju internetsku vezu. Ako problem i dalje postoji, "
"pokušajte ažurirati popis ogledala."
# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 374
msgid ""
"A downloaded package is corrupted.\n"
"Suggestion: Clear the cache with 'sudo pacman -Scc' and try again."
msgstr ""
"Preuzeti paket je oštećen.\n"
"Prijedlog: Očistite predmemoriju naredbom 'sudo pacman -Scc' i pokušajte "
"ponovno."
